# 2. Prototype Scope

### Definition

If the bean scope is **prototype**, Spring creates **a new object every time `getBean()` is called**.

---

### MSME.java

```java
package org.techhub.objdep;

public class MSME {

    public MSME() {
        System.out.println("Constructor Called");
    }
}
```

